{"step_index":264,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T03:08:58Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T12:08:58+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T12:08:58+09:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/01296c65-59e4-4929-80a6-70432881f69a/.system_generated/steps/260/content.md`\nTotal Lines: 687\nTotal Bytes: 45638\nShowing lines 200 to 350\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n200: \t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n201: \t\t\t\t\n202: \n203: \t\t\t\t            \n204:                 \n205: \t\n206: \t\n207: \t\t<div class=\"hgroup\">\n208: \t\t\t<div class=\"category\">Java</div>\n209: \t\t\t<h1>국세청 홈택스의 사업자등록상태조회 웹 스크래핑 하기 </h1>\n210: \t\t\t<div class=\"post-meta\">\n211: \t\t\t\t<span class=\"author\">쌍둥이달</span>\n212: \t\t\t\t<span class=\"date\">2020. 1. 29. 10:47</span>\n213: \t\t\t\t\n214: \t\t\t</div>\n215: \t\t</div>\n216: \t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n217: \t\t\t\n218:                     <!-- System - START -->\n219:         <div class=\"revenue_unit_wrap\">\n220:   <div class=\"revenue_unit_item adsense responsive\">\n221:     <div class=\"revenue_unit_info\">반응형</div>\n222:     <script src=\"//pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js\" async=\"async\"></script>\n223:     <ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-host=\"ca-host-pub-9691043933427338\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-7401629424546368\" data-ad-format=\"auto\"></ins>\n224:     <script>(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});</script>\n225:   </div>\n226: </div>\n227:         <!-- System - END -->\n228: \n229:             <div class=\"contents_style\"><p>회계업무를 수행하다가 보면 관리하고 있는 파트너사가 현재도 유효한 사업자인지 확인을 할 필요가 있다.</p>\n230: <p>보통 이런 정보는 국세청 홈택스의 사업자등록상태조회 서비스를 이용하여 건 by 건으로 조회가 가능하지만 수 많은 파트너사의 정보를 매번 입력하여 조회할 수 없을 것이다.</p>\n231: <p>더구나 조회 후 다음 번 조회까지 5초의 텀을 두고 조회하도록 하고 있기 때문에 많은 데이터를 조회하기에는 불편함이 따른다.</p>\n232: <p>그래서 보통은 회계ERP 업체들이 이런 정보를 제공하여 사용하게 되는데 회계ERP 업체들은 어떻게 이런 정보를 제공할 수 있을까 고민해보면 결국 국세청 홈텍스에서 스크래핑하는 방법 밖에는 없다고 생각된다.</p>\n233: <p>이번 장에서는 앞서 전자세금계산서 데이터를 조회하는 방법을 응용하여 파트너사의 사업자번호로 국세청 홈택스의 사업자등록상태조회 서비스를 호출하여 결과를 받는 내용을 알아보자.</p>\n234: <p>다행인 것은 국세청 홈택스의 사업자등록상태조회 서비스는 로그인 절차가 필요하지 않기 때문에 매우 쉽게 내용을 확인할 수 있다.</p>\n235: <p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\" data-filename=\"홈택스_사업자등록상태조회.jpg\" data-origin-width=\"964\" data-origin-height=\"653\"><span data-url=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rFVJ3/btqBBfNOKRR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN9phL8BNSY991LVFhCI8ldAbW6J8AEM0wqVY45JjJjI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1790780399&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fTejZ0PsB80ftcsAlwI7yPSeoeU%3D\" data-phocus=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rFVJ3/btqBBfNOKRR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN9phL8BNSY991LVFhCI8ldAbW6J8AEM0wqVY45JjJjI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1790780399&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fTejZ0PsB80ftcsAlwI7yPSeoeU%3D\"><img src=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rFVJ3/btqBBfNOKRR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN9phL8BNSY991LVFhCI8ldAbW6J8AEM0wqVY45JjJjI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1790780399&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fTejZ0PsB80ftcsAlwI7yPSeoeU%3D\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2FrFVJ3%2FbtqBBfNOKRR%2FAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN9phL8BNSY991LVFhCI8ldAbW6J8AEM0wqVY45JjJjI%2Fimg.jpg%3Fcredential%3DyqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8%26expires%3D1790780399%26allow_ip%3D%26allow_referer%3D%26signature%3DfTejZ0PsB80ftcsAlwI7yPSeoeU%253D\" data-filename=\"홈택스_사업자등록상태조회.jpg\" data-origin-width=\"964\" data-origin-height=\"653\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png'; this.srcset='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png';\"/></span></figure>\n236: </p>\n237: <p>먼저 크롬 브라우저를 사용하여 국세청 홈택스의 사업자등록상태조회 서비스를 화면에 띄워 놓고 F12 키를 눌러서 개발자모드를 띄운다.</p>\n238: <p>그리고 Network 탭 메뉴를 클릭해서 모니터링 준비를 완료한 상태로 준비해 놓는다.</p>\n239: <p>이후 홈택스 화면에서 사업자등록번호를 입력하고 \"조회하기\" 버튼을 클릭하면 조회결과가 화면에 출력된다.</p>\n240: <p>조회결과를 확인했으면 우리가 필요한 기록이 다른 액션에 의해 밀려나기 전에 개발자모드의 Network 탭에 붉은 색 동그라미를 클릭해서 Recoding 상태를 비활성화 한다.</p>\n241: <p>그 다음 출력된 기록 중에서 wqAction.do에 해당하는 항목을 찾아서 클릭하면 Request URL과 Request Payload, Query String Parameters 등을 알아볼 수 있다.</p>\n242: <p>이 중 Request Payload를 살펴보면 우리가 입력했던 사업자등록번호가 //map/txprDscmNo 항목에 입력된 것을 알 수 있다.</p>\n243: <p>그리고 //map/dongCode에는 사업자번호 중간(2자리)의 내용이 들어간다.</p>\n244: <pre id=\"code_1580262224831\" class=\"html xml\" data-ke-type=\"codeblock\" data-ke-language=\"html\"><code>&lt;map id=\"ATTABZAA001R08\"&gt;\n245:     &lt;pubcUserNo/&gt;\n246:     &lt;mobYn&gt;N&lt;/mobYn&gt;\n247:     &lt;inqrTrgtClCd&gt;1&lt;/inqrTrgtClCd&gt;\n248:     &lt;txprDscmNo&gt;사업자번호(10자리)&lt;/txprDscmNo&gt;\n249:     &lt;dongCode&gt;사업자번호중간(2자리)&lt;/dongCode&gt;\n250:     &lt;psbSearch&gt;Y&lt;/psbSearch&gt;\n251:     &lt;map id=\"userReqInfoVO\"/&gt;\n252: &lt;/map&gt;</code></pre>\n253: <p>이렇게&nbsp;호출한&nbsp;결과는&nbsp;아래와&nbsp;같이&nbsp;XML로&nbsp;리턴&nbsp;받는다.</p>\n254: <pre id=\"code_1580262240972\" class=\"html xml\" data-ke-type=\"codeblock\" data-ke-language=\"html\"><code>&lt;map id=\"\"&gt;\n255:    &lt;map id=\"resultMsg\"&gt;\n256:       &lt;detailMsg /&gt;\n257:       &lt;msg /&gt;\n258:       &lt;code /&gt;\n259:       &lt;result&gt;S&lt;/result&gt;\n260:    &lt;/map&gt;\n261:    &lt;trtEndCd&gt;Y&lt;/trtEndCd&gt;\n262:    &lt;smpcBmanEnglTrtCntn&gt;The business registration number is registered&lt;/smpcBmanEnglTrtCntn&gt;\n263:    &lt;nrgtTxprYn&gt;N&lt;/nrgtTxprYn&gt;\n264:    &lt;smpcBmanTrtCntn&gt;등록되어 있는 사업자등록번호 입니다.&lt;/smpcBmanTrtCntn&gt;\n265:    &lt;trtCntn&gt;부가가치세 일반과세자 입니다.&lt;/trtCntn&gt;\n266: &lt;/map&gt;</code></pre>\n267: <p>우리가 필요한 항목은 //map/trtCntn에 한글로 내용이 기록되어 있다.</p>\n268: <p>그러면 위의 내용을 바탕으로 Jsoup으로 아래와 같은 클래스를 작성한다.</p>\n269: <pre id=\"code_1580262262494\" class=\"java\" data-ke-type=\"codeblock\" data-ke-language=\"java\"><code>public class ScrapingTaxTypeFromNts {\n270: \n271:     private final Logger logger = LoggerFactory.getLogger(this.getClass());\n272:     \n273:     public ScrapingTaxTypeFromNts() {\n274:         \n275:     }\n276:     \n277:     /**\n278:      * 국세청 홈텍스에서 사업자과세유형을 조회하여 반환.\n279:      * @param listBusinessRegNo\n280:      * @return\n281:      */\n282:     public List&lt;Map&lt;String, String&gt;&gt; selectTaxTypeFromNts(List&lt;String&gt; listBusinessRegNo) {\n283:         List&lt;Map&lt;String, String&gt;&gt; list = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();\n284:         for (String businessRegNo : listBusinessRegNo) {\n285:             list.add(getTaxTypeFromNts(businessRegNo));\n286:         }\n287:         return list;\n288:     }\n289:     \n290:     /**\n291:      * 국세청 홈텍스에서 사업자과세유형을 조회하여 반환.\n292:      * @param businessRegNo\n293:      * @return\n294:      */\n295:     public Map&lt;String, String&gt; getTaxTypeFromNts(String businessRegNo) {\n296:         \n297:         if (null == businessRegNo || \"\".equals(businessRegNo)) {\n298:             throw new RuntimeException(\"조회할 사업자등록번호를 입력해주세요.\");\n299:         }\n300:         \n301:         String txprDscmNo     = StringUtils.replace(businessRegNo, \"-\", \"\");\n302:         if (txprDscmNo.length() != 10) {\n303:             throw new RuntimeException(\"조회할 사업자등록번호를 올바로 입력해주세요.\");\n304:         }\n305:         \n306:         String dongCode     = txprDscmNo.substring(3, 5);\n307:         \n308:         String url = \"https://teht.hometax.go.kr/wqAction.do?actionId=ATTABZAA001R08&amp;screenId=UTEABAAA13&amp;popupYn=false&amp;realScreenId=\";\n309:         \n310:         Map&lt;String, String&gt; headers = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\n311:         headers.put(\"Accept\", \"application/xml; charset=UTF-8\");\n312:         headers.put(\"Accept-Encoding\", \"gzip, deflate, br\");\n313:         headers.put(\"Accept-Language\", \"ko-KR,ko;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,en;q=0.7\");\n314:         headers.put(\"Connection\", \"keep-alive\");\n315:         headers.put(\"Content-Length\", \"257\");\n316:         headers.put(\"Content-Type\", \"application/xml; charset=UTF-8\");\n317:         headers.put(\"Host\", \"teht.hometax.go.kr\");\n318:         headers.put(\"Origin\", \"https://teht.hometax.go.kr\");\n319:         headers.put(\"Referer\", \"https://teht.hometax.go.kr/websquare/websquare.html?w2xPath=/ui/ab/a/a/UTEABAAA13.xml\");\n320:         headers.put(\"Sec-Fetch-Mode\", \"cors\");\n321:         headers.put(\"Sec-Fetch-Site\", \"same-origin\");\n322:         headers.put(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/79.0.3945.130 Safari/537.36\");\n323:         \n324:         final String CRLF = \"\\n\";\n325:         \n326:         StringBuffer sb = new StringBuffer();\n327:         sb.append(\"&lt;map id=\\\"ATTABZAA001R08\\\"&gt;\" + CRLF);\n328:         sb.append(\"    &lt;pubcUserNo/&gt;\" + CRLF);\n329:         sb.append(\"    &lt;mobYn&gt;N&lt;/mobYn&gt;\" + CRLF);\n330:         sb.append(\"    &lt;inqrTrgtClCd&gt;1&lt;/inqrTrgtClCd&gt;\" + CRLF);\n331:         sb.append(\"    &lt;txprDscmNo&gt;\" + txprDscmNo + \"&lt;/txprDscmNo&gt;\" + CRLF);\n332:         sb.append(\"    &lt;dongCode&gt;\" + dongCode + \"&lt;/dongCode&gt;\" + CRLF);\n333:         sb.append(\"    &lt;psbSearch&gt;Y&lt;/psbSearch&gt;\" + CRLF);\n334:         sb.append(\"    &lt;map id=\\\"userReqInfoVO\\\"/&gt;\" + CRLF);\n335:         sb.append(\"&lt;/map&gt;\" + CRLF);\n336:         \n337:         String body = sb.toString();\n338:         \n339:         Map&lt;String, String&gt; map = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\n340:         try {\n341:             Response res = Jsoup.connect(url)\n342:                     .headers(headers)\n343:                     .requestBody(body)\n344:                     .timeout(3000)\n345:                     .method(Method.POST)\n346:                     .execute();\n347:             \n348:             if (logger.isDebugEnabled()) {\n349:                 logger.debug(res.body());\n350:             }\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":265,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T03:09:03Z","thinking":"The host is definitely `teht.hometax.go.kr`, not the `www` subdomain. The URL structure confirms the intended domain. Observed headers include `Referer`, `Origin`, and `Host`, suggesting the application is correctly targeting the correct subdomain.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction checkHometax(bno) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const cleanNo = bno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    const dongCode = cleanNo.substring(3, 5);\n    const body = `<map id=\"ATTABZAA001R08\">\n<pubcUserNo/>\n<mobYn>N</mobYn>\n<inqrTrgtClCd>1</inqrTrgtClCd>\n<txprDscmNo>${cleanNo}</txprDscmNo>\n<dongCode>${dongCode}</dongCode>\n<psbSearch>Y</psbSearch>\n<map id=\"userReqInfoVO\"/>\n</map>`;\n\n    const options = {\n      hostname: 'teht.hometax.go.kr',\n      port: 443,\n      path: '/wqAction.do?actionId=ATTABZAA001R08&screenId=UTEABAAA13&popupYn=false&realScreenId=',\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/xml; charset=UTF-8',\n        'Accept': 'application/xml; charset=UTF-8',\n        'Referer': 'https://teht.hometax.go.kr/websquare/websquare.html?w2xPath=/ui/ab/a/a/UTEABAAA13.xml',\n        'Origin': 'https://teht.hometax.go.kr',\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\n      }\n    };\n\n    const req = https.request(options, res => {\n      let data = '';\n      res.on('data', chunk => data += chunk);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(data));\n    });\n\n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.write(body);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n  try {\n    const res = await checkHometax('1058802863');\n    console.log('=== HOMETAX RESPONSE ===');\n    console.log(res);\n  } catch(e) {\n    console.error(e);\n  }\n}\n\nmain();\n","Description":"Check Hometax status via teht.hometax.go.kr","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\01296c65-59e4-4929-80a6-70432881f69a\\scratch\\call_teht.js","toolAction":"Writing call_teht.js","toolSummary":"Write teht Hometax script"}}]}
